  "storyPlan": {
    "premise": "**How to Build an AI Employee in 60 Seconds**\n\nAn educational video showing how anyone can create their own AI employee using AI agents and automation tools. The idea is to demonstrate how to turn a repetitive task into an autonomous workflow where an AI agent is given a specific role, responsibilities, and access to the tools it needs to complete its job.\n\nThe video will use a practical example of an AI employee that researches trending topics, generates content ideas, writes scripts, and organizes everything into a content calendar.\n\nThe goal is to inspire viewers to stop using AI only as a chatbot and start building their own AI-powered systems that can actually do work for them."
  },
